>\n        <h1>PSIT Kanpur</h1>\n        <p>Premier Institute of Technology – Shaping Future Innovators</p>\n    </header>\n    <nav>\n        <a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"#departments\">Departments</a>\n        <a href=\"#events\">Events</a>\n        <a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n    </nav>\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <h2>Welcome to PSIT Kanpur</h2>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <section id=\"about\" class=\"section\">\n            <h2>About PSIT</h2>\n            <p>Established in 2005, PSIT Kanpur is a leading engineering college offering undergraduate and postgraduate programs across various disciplines. Our mission is to foster academic excellence, research, and industry collaboration.</p>\n        </section>\n        <section id=\"departments\" class=\"section\">\n            <h2>Our Departments</h2>\n            <div class=\"cards\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/300x150?text=CSE\" alt=\"Computer Science\">\n                    <div class=\"card-content\">\n                        <h3>Computer Science & Engineering</h3>\n                        <p>Cutting‑edge curriculum focusing on AI, Data Science, and Software Development.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/300x150?text=ECE\" alt=\"Electronics\">\n                    <div class=\"card-content\">\n                        <h3>Electronics & Communication Engineering</h3>\n                        <p>Hands‑on labs and projects in VLSI, IoT, and embedded systems.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/300x150?text=ME\" alt=\"Mechanical\">\n                    <div class=\"card-content\">\n                        <h3>Mechanical Engineering</h3>\n            